# The `f1aV0t` reduction of set (e)

The label-split certificate of `QED.Algebra.IBPCertSector` reduces the trace projection `T₁ = 8 F₁`
of the lower-loop piece `f1a_V0` (topology `f1a`, 0 mass-counterterm insertions)
